    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Back up n8n workflows to GitHub\nSaves every workflow on this instance as `<repo.path>/<workflow name>.json` in a GitHub repo, and commits only when a workflow is new or has changed.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Select an **n8n API** credential on the `n8n` node\n2. Select a **GitHub API** credential (personal access token) on the three GitHub nodes\n3. Set your repo in `Globals`\n4. Click **Test workflow**, check the repo, then activate\n\nFull guide: https://github.com/anilrajrimal1/n8n-backups",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "844ab738-9c4b-4c8a-b328-1d863201303f",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1340,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Set your repo\n`repo.owner`: GitHub user or org\n`repo.name`: backup repo\n`repo.path`: folder, ends with `/`",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a2739b9e-d441-498c-bb2f-1314ec18ce23",
      "name": "Configure here",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1140,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Only commit what changed\n`isDiffOrNew` sorts the keys of the stored file and of the live workflow, compares them, and tags each one **same**, **different** or **new**. Only *different* and *new* reach GitHub.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "c5ce3278-c32b-4a79-b8ed-c18da64a572c",
      "name": "Compare and route",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        560
      ]
    }
